        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Browse the brewing supplies",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "still_shelf"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "supplies_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Keep the candle lit",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You met the bogged up top? I made that. Summoned it myself, out of the mushroom-damp and a book I am absolutely not supposed to have. It is a servant for the witch of the North Rise house. Puddle assisted. Puddle, tell them you assisted. ...He is being modest. He held the candle."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The witch does not come down. Ever. Nobody has seen her, which is the proof — the important ones are always the ones you do not see. She required a keeper for the rise, so I provided one. Bog and bones and one borrowed word I will not be repeating. Worked first try. Mostly first try."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "If you are carrying rotten flesh, take it up top to the bogged. It is the rent — the witch counts it, the bogged eats it, everyone up the chain stays pleasant. It does not bite unless she says, and she has said nothing yet, which I choose to read as approval of my work."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Auntie Bramblea says the gym leader trains blindfolded. Wrong. Titania is a GHOST, and ghosts do not need eyes. Nobody I know has seen her up close. I know how the unseen operate now. Professionally."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Elowen bottles the marsh and sells you the finished thing. Respectable. I sell what goes IN the cauldron — rods, wart, dusts, an eye I keep double-jarred. The witch has me stock it. Do not ask me which of it is for her. I do not ask either."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thistrel Fogroot",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Blaze Rod — 300 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_blaze_rod"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_blaze_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Nether Wart — 60 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_nether_wart"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_wart_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Glowstone Dust — 80 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_glowstone_dust"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_glowstone_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "The stranger jars",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "odd_jars"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "odd_jars_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Back to Thistrel",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The still shelf. Blaze rods — genuine, traded off a courier who did not love carrying them through a wetland, which is why they cost what they cost. Wart for the base of everything. Glowstone dust for strength; wisp-shed, I gather it respectfully. The stranger jars are behind me, ask and I will turn around."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thistrel — the still shelf",
                    Label: "still_shelf"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Redstone Dust — 40 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_redstone_dust"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_redstone_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Gunpowder — 40 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_gunpowder"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_gunpowder_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Fermented Spider Eye — 90 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_fermented_eye"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_eye_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "The still shelf",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "still_shelf"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "still_shelf_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Back to Thistrel",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The odd jars. Redstone stretches a brew longer — the witch prefers her workings unhurried. Sneeze powder turns a bottle into a splash, do not open it near the candle. And the fermented eye turns a brew INSIDE OUT, which sounds bad, and is, on purpose. Double-jarred. Absolutely not for eating."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thistrel — the odd jars",
                    Label: "odd_jars"
                }
            ]
        },
